          "symbol": "LocalChoice.forward",
          "expression": "def forward(self, x, report=False):\n    a = x.sin()\n    b = a.cos()\n    c = b.tanh()\n    d = c.relu()\n    e = d.sin()\n    f = e.cos()\n    g = f.tanh()\n    h = g.relu()\n    if report:\n        return (h, b)\n    return h"
        }
      ],
